OL,3,AMichael Marra announced as new Scottish
OL,4,ALabour leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FMichael Marra has been announced as the
OL,7,Fnext Scottish Labour leader.
OL,9,FHe received 4266 votes from Labour
OL,10,Fmembers, compared with Joe Fagan's
OL,11,F2485.
OL,13,FAlmost half of party members turned out
OL,14,Fto vote in the leadership contest.
OL,16,FMarra takes over as leader following
OL,17,FAnas Sarwar's decision to stand down in
OL,18,Forder to take up a seat in the House of
OL,19,FLords.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
